{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:352d4c53e10e2f1e54b0cd21424435e8e4a4147c829c88ca382822efcb82aa23",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c1f29d645fc691f70b54dd613546f0b350772afcc67be4610248733009e2c1",
      "text": "为了这一天，全员一心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99e1df13c4594b08375d62e159d4c1398179543a0aa2a4b5433276472c414d97",
      "text": "好……终于到了演出当天啊！\n翔太、北斗，拿出干劲上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09cdb47ac6f561d0645d0938362749dbadf1cf1413128b95129932e74a0bf8b5",
      "text": "一大早就干劲满满呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ea7a7015f0106fc848446f63d61879334ff23bc8743c313202375c53456161",
      "text": "就算你不说，干劲也早已十足啦。\n只要有我在，今天的演唱会也绝对大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:281e54f997a9e0631069627a92c577f3066b96f04e1fb2a8d8e2292ac9117341",
      "text": "大家一起让天使酱、小天使们\n尽情享受吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d7349a62ffb89706efa470e8cfdbf09361b8d7f4f207789bb759851e154d924",
      "text": "而且，一想到终于能展示大家共同筹备的\n服装和歌曲，就让人心潮澎湃呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134b141d5ada9cd4d1a1fa8875d749f0541366638458df0eb80537218fe55a46",
      "text": "是和C.FIRST还有大家一起做出的歌曲啊。\n每个人为了今天都做出了自己的挑战呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c270cc8d026c212c3c2680271abbf1287bd886dc0c3d280a2ffbb5ba27ac5afd",
      "text": "嗯，舞台的演出，还有其他的企划也是哦！\n粉丝大家会露出怎样的表情呢～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ea6a2809a16e932446c8565b410353e10903782a9537a41627bac2b35f00445",
      "text": "每一项都是315 Pro的全员偶像共同打造的\n宝贵结晶，好好传递给他们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0d2b586f110ebc6e4795dbe693b7a3221a66ebbd2cede8b638a1ac4c791c8f0",
      "text": "……为了这一天，大家一起筹备了这么久。\n只要全员齐心协力，一定会成为最美好的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_016_22_5_06_016_22:5_06_016_22:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c7d0ee25524802bfb16058cedf8a245be19d32de7fc7234ffac20e47c223d23",
      "text": "就让他们见识见识，一生都难以忘怀的、\n超级震撼的演唱会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
